{"synopsis":"Min-su Lee adalah pemimpin tim ESG di konglomerat besar Soya Group. Wajahnya selalu datar, hidupnya sederhana, dan prinsipnya cuma satu: “Kerja boleh ribet, tapi pulang harus tepat waktu!”\n\nSayangnya, kedamaian itu buyar begitu Kang Chae-eun, putri bungsu sang ketua perusahaan, tiba-tiba masuk ke timnya. Sejak hari pertama, suasana jadi heboh—mulai dari drama politik kantor, rekan kerja tukang cari muka, sampai bos-bos yang hobi bikin masalah.\n\nTanpa mau, Min-su terseret ke pusaran intrik kantor yang absurd. Tapi di balik semua itu, tekadnya tetap sama:pulang kerja tepat waktu.\n\nApakah Min-su bisa mempertahankan mimpi sucinya untuk pulang kerja tepat waktu? Atau malah terjebak selamanya dalam drama kantor yang penuh gila-gilaan?","alternative_title":"오늘도 퇴근","author":"Parsher, White Grass","artist":"Underwater","chapters":[{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"7c8c4b83-dd32-4766-bc0b-0a0e46b9d8b1","date":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"c983af50-9908-48f0-ba80-0399211ce100","date":"2026-07-23","images":[]},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"fa576bdd-f327-47ef-980e-d9dc2cc59556","date":"2026-07-16","images":[]},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"ba60a2b2-ff3a-4059-92ea-33ff759b9177","date":"2026-07-16","images":[]},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"31b9c159-552a-4c1b-b413-136308513753","date":"2026-07-09","images":[]},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"41900cbb-c12f-4d72-883c-1df38f497ae6","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"1234aa26-bc0d-4026-be98-3540ab53f702","date":"2026-06-13","images":[]},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"b4f65bb2-14e8-4d98-a529-4a441c07e1dd","date":"2026-06-10","images":[]},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"e9c20f7d-0c64-4ced-912c-c29aea4eaddb","date":"2026-06-09","images":[]},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"4a0d712c-f0df-44d8-b2ba-2606109e0bb0","date":"2026-06-09","images":[]},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"043d47b5-7872-409a